SDL-E1040 (spec/access.md)

  x clause does not apply to this access variant: clause `for` is not part of the `jwt` access vocabulary — it belongs to a bearer access
   ,----
 1 | access sso { on: root; type: jwt; for: user; url: 'https://x/jwks'; };
   :                              ^|^
   :                               `-- not this variant's clause
   `----
  help: each `access` variant defines its own clauses — check `type:` and the variant's clause list in the linked spec
